{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-wilds-aldar-properties-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":70,"crm_id":"4425","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"The Wilds","slug":"the-wilds-aldar-properties-dubailand","display_address":"Dubailand","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Aldar Properties","price":5100000,"display_price":"5.1M","lattitude":25.0910411,"longitude":55.3784577,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Wilds by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-aldar-properties/\">Aldar </a>is Dubai’s newest eco-luxury community, blending nature with premium living. Offering<strong> 3 to 5-bedroom Cassia Villas and 4 to 5-bedroom Ravenna Residences</strong>, this green sanctuary by Aldar is set amidst native wildlife, scenic trails, and lush woodlands. This unique development fosters wellness and sustainability while embracing a serene, natural lifestyle. Located in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand</a>, with quick access to major highways, The Wilds is designed for those seeking an escape into nature without compromising urban convenience. Residents will enjoy immersive experiences with bird nests, bee-keeping zones, and diverse ecosystems featuring pond, lawn, and dry stream habitats. &nbsp;</p><p>The signature ‘Nest’ clubhouse, wildlife observation areas, and environmental learning spaces make this community a haven for families and nature lovers. With a premium international school, sports facilities, wellness pavilions, and interactive play zones, The Wilds is where luxury meets mindful living—an inspiring retreat where nature and modern comfort thrive together.</p>","tile_