hash":"The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_8fdf708730","name":"The Wilds by Aldar Properties"},"style":null,"title":"The Wilds – Where Luxury Lives in Harmony with Nature","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Eco-Luxury Living – A unique residential community blending nature with premium living, featuring the UAE’s most diverse native wildlife sanctuary. &nbsp;</li><li>Exclusive Villa Collections – Choose from Cassia Villas (3 to 5-bedroom) and Ravenna Residences (4 to 5-bedroom), designed for privacy and modern comfort. &nbsp;</li><li>Prime Location &amp; Connectivity – Situated near Al Barari, Arabian Ranches, and major highways, ensuring seamless access to key Dubai destinations. &nbsp;</li><li>Immersive Natural Landscapes – Woodland sanctuaries, eco-corridors, ponds, and dry stream habitats provide a lush, serene environment. &nbsp;</li><li>Family-Centric Amenities – Includes a premium international school, nurseries, interactive play zones, and adaptive playgrounds. &nbsp;</li><li>Wellness &amp; Sports Facilities – State-of-the-art fitness zones, cycling trails, tennis, padel, and basketball courts, plus meditation spaces. &nbsp;</li><li>Resort-Style Leisure – Enjoy resort-inspired pools, shaded wellness pavilions, and ‘cocoon’ hammocks for ultimate relaxation.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1385,"cta":{"id":2159,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_3bb491b58a.jpg","hash":"The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_3bb491b58a","name":"The Wilds by Aldar Properties"},"style":null,"title":"The Wilds – Connected to Nature & City","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Wilds is strategically located near Al Barari and Majan, offering seamless connectivity to key Dubai destinations. Nestled along Sheikh Mohammed bin Zayed Road, it provides easy access to Arabian Ranches, Meydan South Villas, and Living Legends. Residents are just minutes from IMG Worlds of Adventure, Hamdan Sports Complex, and Global Village. Surrounded by lush landscapes and eco-corridors, The Wilds ensures a tranquil retreat while keeping urban conveniences within reach, making it an ideal choice for nature lovers and families.</p>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3673,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":2391,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":3313,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_c766dbeb8e.jpg","hash":"The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_c766dbeb8e","name":"The Wilds by Aldar Properties"},"title":"3 Bedroom Villas","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3314,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_85ed2481c2.jpg","hash":"The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_85ed2481c2","name":"The Wilds by Aldar Properties"},"title":"4 Bedroom Villas","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3315,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_0f0735dd8e.jpg","hash":"The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_0f0735dd8e","name":"The Wilds by Aldar Properties"},"title":"5 Bedroom Villas","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":" 65/35","payment_plans":[{"id":9758,"title":"65%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":9759,"title":"35%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Dubailand","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":22108,"url":null,"text":" The Nest Clubhouse","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22109,"url":null,"text":"Scenic walking & cycling trails","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22110,"url":null,"text":"Resort-style pools & fitness studios","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22111,"url":null,"text":"Playgrounds & interactive learning spaces","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22112,"url":null,"text":" Premium international school & nurseries","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22113,"url":null,"text":" Wellness pavilions & meditation zones","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1136,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Wilds","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Wilds","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Dubailand"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_918a459b8f.jpg","hash":"The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_918a459b8f","name":"The Wilds by Aldar Properties"},"seo":{"id":1648,"metaTitle":"The Wilds by Aldar Properties","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Discover The Wilds by Aldar, a nature-inspired community in Dubai with 3 to 5-bedroom villas, lush greenery, wildlife, scenic trails, and premium amenities. "},"more_info":[{"id":5498,"answer":"<p>Both villa collections are nestled within Dubai’s largest residential wildlife sanctuary, ensuring a blend of luxury, sustainability, and privacy. Residents will enjoy eco-corridors, natural landscapes, and access to The Nest clubhouse, scenic trails, and wellness spaces.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes Cassia Villas and Ravenna Residences unique?"},{"id":5499,"answer":"<p>The Wilds offers a flexible 65/35 payment plan, with a 10% down payment. This ensures a hassle-free investment while securing a home in one of Dubai’s most anticipated eco-communities.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for The Wilds?"},{"id":5500,"answer":"<p>The handover is scheduled for Q2 2029, making it a strategic investment opportunity for those looking to own a nature-integrated luxury home in Dubai.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is the expected handover for The Wilds?"},{"id":5501,"answer":"<p>Residents of Cassia Villas and Ravenna Residences will enjoy a nature-inspired lifestyle with access to:<br>✔ The Nest Clubhouse<br>✔ Scenic walking &amp; cycling trails<br>✔ Resort-style pools &amp; fitness studios<br>✔ Playgrounds &amp; interactive learning spaces<br>✔ Premium international school &amp; nurseries<br>✔ Wellness pavilions &amp; meditation zones<br>The Wilds is where luxury, nature, and modern living come together in perfect harmony.</p>","question":"What lifestyle amenities are available for residents?"},{"id":5502,"answer":"<p>The Wilds offers a flexible payment plan, starting with just 10% down payment, followed by structured installments leading up to the handover in Q2 2029.</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for The Wilds by Aldar?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_1e30e20a01.jpg","src_cftle":"i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_1e30e20a01.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/420x/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_1e30e20a01.webp","format":"webp","transform":"420x","created_at":"2025-02-24 11:55:29.080","updated_at":"2025-02-24 11:55:29.080"}]},{"src_url":"i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_3bb491b58a.jpg","src_cftle":"i/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_3bb491b58a.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_3bb491b58a.webp","format":"webp","transform":"340x","created_at":"2025-02-24 11:56:26.545","updated_at":"2025-02-24 11:56:27.012"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1392x/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_3bb491b58a.web